<title>FRANCE: EU also sells German intervention rye - ONIC.</title>
<headline>EU also sells German intervention rye - ONIC.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday sold 9,622 tonnes of German intervention rye at a minimum price of 100.13 Ecus per tonne, France's grain office said.</p>
<p>ONIC also confirmed earlier grain industry reports that the EU's grain panel sold 234,324 tonnes of German intervention barley at a minimum price of 105.07 Ecus per tonnes for export to non-EU states.</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
